  "details": "The properties of the VRC Phys Bone Collider component in the SDK don't appear to have any affect when modified in the editor Playmode. \nI would expect the transforms affected by the collider to update as I changed the collider properties, but it seems to only recognize the initial values (Figure 3 and Figure 4 were screenshotted in the same editor Playmode instance after changing the Position property). \nThe figures attached only show changes in Position, but the behavior is the same no matter the change to the collider. \nThis isn't the end of the world, but it makes it significantly harder to create and test PhysBone colliders.",
